\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Jehovah, be merciful
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 unto me, Lord, I've wronged you
\par I've sinned against you Lord
\par But I can feel all the pains
\par it puts a burden on me.
\par O, help, redeem me, my Saviour.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  If I conceal all my sins
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and do not tell it all out
\par You know and know it all
\par So I make a confession
\par Of every sin I commit
\par That you my God will forgive me
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Jesus, by your precious blood
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 you saved me from all my sins
\par and my iniquities
\par O, let me through this blessings
\par turn to you forever more
\par and have the everlasting life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  You are my true hidden place;
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 In you I will find shelter,
\par Take me for evermore.
\par I shall be with you always
\par on this earth and in heaven:
\par \pard      Jesus, my everlasting God.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

